{"page":474,"verses":[{"verse_key":"40:59","surah":40,"ayah":59,"ar_uthmani":"إِنَّ ٱلسَّاعَةَ لَـَٔاتِيَةٌ لَّا رَيْبَ فِيهَا وَلَـٰكِنَّ أَكْثَرَ ٱلنَّاسِ لَا يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The Final Hour is sure to come, without doubt, but most people do not believe.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"إِنَّ","en_gloss":"Indeed","transliteration":"inna","verse_key":"40:59"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلسَّاعَةَ","en_gloss":"the Hour","transliteration":"l-sāʿata","verse_key":"40:59"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَـَٔاتِيَةٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) surely coming","transliteration":"laātiyatun","verse_key":"40:59"},{"pos":4,"ar":"لَّا","en_gloss":"no","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"40:59"},{"pos":5,"ar":"رَيْبَ","en_gloss":"doubt","transliteration":"rayba","verse_key":"40:59"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فِيهَا","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"fīhā","verse_key":"40:59"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَلَـٰكِنَّ","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"walākinna","verse_key":"40:59"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَكْثَرَ","en_gloss":"most","transliteration":"akthara","verse_key":"40:59"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسِ","en_gloss":"(of) the people","transliteration":"l-nāsi","verse_key":"40:59"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"40:59"},{"pos":11,"ar":"يُؤْمِنُونَ","en_gloss":"believe","transliteration":"yu'minūna","verse_key":"40:59"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٥٩","en_gloss":"(59)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"40:59"}]},{"verse_key":"40:60","surah":40,"ayah":60,"ar_uthmani":"وَقَالَ رَبُّكُمُ ٱدْعُونِىٓ أَسْتَجِبْ لَكُمْ ۚ إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ يَسْتَكْبِرُونَ عَنْ عِبَادَتِى سَيَدْخُلُونَ جَهَنَّمَ دَاخِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Your Lord says, ‘Call on Me and I will answer you; those who are too proud to serve Me will enter Hell humiliated.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَقَالَ","en_gloss":"And said","transliteration":"waqāla","verse_key":"40:60"},{"pos":2,"ar":"رَبُّكُمُ","en_gloss":"your Lord","transliteration":"rabbukumu","verse_key":"40:60"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱدْعُونِىٓ","en_gloss":"Call upon Me